    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "The figure below shows a face geometry (see [`ARSCNFaceGeometry`](arscnfacegeometry.md)) in two states, demonstrating values of `0.0` and `1.0` for this coefficient.",
