      "sourceHash": "8bd702e5213baa26e09314d016cc2d09f7e5cc7b52f5d0818519a5748515611d",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "In both states, the values for all other [`ARFaceAnchor.BlendShapeLocation`](arfaceanchor/blendshapelocation.md) coefficients are set to `0.0`.",
      "ko": "두 상태 모두 다른 모든 [`ARFaceAnchor.BlendShapeLocation`](arfaceanchor/blendshapelocation.md) 계수 값은 `0.0`으로 설정됩니다.",
